> Set your CFLAGS and CXXFLAGS environment variables before calling configure
> and make.
>
> Example:
> CFLAGS="-march=native -pipe -ggdb" CXXFLAGS="${CFLAGS}" ./configure
> CFLAGS="-march=native -pipe -ggdb" CXXFLAGS="${CFLAGS}" make
> etc
